half_light_radius,point,*,both,given,,,,,x_dwarfs_rh_err_hi_arcmin,as_released,dw_rhalf_wolf,,not_published,each system's structural original (observables half_light_radius source_ref),docs/sources/readings/step-a-2026-11-04/dwarfs-adjudication.md (R_h measurement error),"§2a rule 7: g_obs ∝ 1/R_h, g_bar ∝ 1/R_h² (stars and gas); left out of both point columns. Two-sided: x_dwarfs_rh_err_lo_arcmin holds the other side (rule 6)"
