deprojection_4_3,dataset,*,both,given,,1.305,1.352,r½/R_h,,range,dw_rhalf_wolf,,not_published,"Wolf et al. 2010, arXiv 0908.2995",l. 1793–1800; l. 150–152,"a parameter term (§2a rule 4). Wolf et al. 2010 Appendix table (l. 1793–1800): Plummer 1.305 to Sérsic n = 8 1.352; ""accurate to better than 2%"" (l. 150–152). 4/3 is the default"
distance,system,*,both,given,,,,,x_dwarfs_distance_err_hi_kpc,as_released,dw_distance,,not_published,each system's distance source (observables distance source_ref),adjudication F1,"g_obs ∝ 1/D; g_bar_stars ∝ D^e with e from x_dwarfs_gbar_stars_distance_exponent (0, or −2 for Boötes III, D-061 item 2); gas ∝ D⁰ (adjudication F1). Two-sided: x_dwarfs_distance_err_lo_kpc holds the other side (rule 6)"
